abstract: "Kernels, serving recipe, verification method and measured results for running Bonsai 2 27B (PTQ1_0 ternary) as a coding-agent inference engine on a single NVIDIA P104-100: 2x prefill, 2.6x drafted decode, 2.7x decode at 49k context, 29% less power, output statistically unchanged. Includes the negative results."
